[{"answer":"Good morning.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/1.mp3"},{"answer":"So, we've looked at various aspects of staff selection this term and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/2.mp3"},{"answer":"I think by now you should be beginning to see","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/3.mp3"},{"answer":"how much more there is to it than just putting applicants through a short interview","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/4.mp3"},{"answer":"or asking the 'right' questions.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/5.mp3"},{"answer":"So I think you should be ready for today's tutorial on 'matching the person to the job'.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/6.mp3"},{"answer":"We're going to talk today about the importance of choosing that all round 'right' person.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/7.mp3"},{"answer":"Right. So we have to put ourselves into the role of the manager or supervisor?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/8.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/9.mp3"},{"answer":"And then we're going to imagine how different applicants would fit into the team or group they have to work with...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/10.mp3"},{"answer":"we'll look at some examples later.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/11.mp3"},{"answer":"It's just theoretical at the moment...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/12.mp3"},{"answer":"Yes.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/13.mp3"},{"answer":"The point is, you can select someone - even a friend -","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/14.mp3"},{"answer":"who has all the right qualifications, degrees, certificates, whatever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/15.mp3"},{"answer":"You can also check that they have a lot of experience...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/16.mp3"},{"answer":"that they've done the sort of tasks that you want them to do in your office already,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/17.mp3"},{"answer":"in a similar environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/18.mp3"},{"answer":"But if they start work","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/19.mp3"},{"answer":"and you realise that they just don't get along with everybody else, that...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/20.mp3"},{"answer":"say, they've got sharply contrasting views on how something will work...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/21.mp3"},{"answer":"well, with the best will in the world, you may be backing a loser.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/22.mp3"},{"answer":"Wouldn't it be just a question of company training, though?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/23.mp3"},{"answer":"Not always.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/24.mp3"},{"answer":"Particularly in a team situation,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/25.mp3"},{"answer":"and I think it's important to think in terms of that type of working environment.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/26.mp3"},{"answer":"People have to have faith in each other's ability to carry out the task their boss has set them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/27.mp3"},{"answer":"They have to trust that everyone will do their part of the job,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/28.mp3"},{"answer":"and you can't necessarily train people for this.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/29.mp3"},{"answer":"But it's like trying to find out what someone's personality is like in a job interview...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/30.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean... you just can't do that.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/31.mp3"},{"answer":"Even if you try, you won't find out what they're really like until they actually start work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/32.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, in most interviews you usually ask candidates questions about their hobbies and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/33.mp3"},{"answer":"what they like doing in their spare time...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/34.mp3"},{"answer":"that sort of thing...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/35.mp3"},{"answer":"so, employers are already involved in the practice of...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/36.mp3"},{"answer":"well, doing part of the task.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/37.mp3"},{"answer":"But it doesn't tell you anything.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/38.mp3"},{"answer":"It doesn't tell you if they're easy-going or hate smokers or whatever.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/39.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, arguably it does give you a bit of information about an applicant's character,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/40.mp3"},{"answer":"but also more and more employers around the world are making use of what are called 'personality questionnaires'","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/42-2023-09-11-23-07-50.mp3"},{"answer":"to help them select new staff and...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/43.mp3"},{"answer":"What's it called?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/44.mp3"},{"answer":"A Personality Questionnaire.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/45.mp3"},{"answer":"They have to be filled out by the candidates some time during the selection procedure,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/46.mp3"},{"answer":"often just before an interview.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/47.mp3"},{"answer":"The idea is actually quite old.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/48.mp3"},{"answer":"Apparently they were used by the ancient Chinese for picking out clerks and civil servants,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/49.mp3"},{"answer":"and then later they were used by the military to put people in appropriate areas of work.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/50.mp3"},{"answer":"They've gained a lot of ground since then","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/51.mp3"},{"answer":"and there are about 80,000 different tests available now","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/52.mp3"},{"answer":"and almost two thirds of the large employers use them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/53.mp3"},{"answer":"Which makes you think that there must be something in them.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/54.mp3"},{"answer":"That's right.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/55.mp3"},{"answer":"They ask the sort of questions that you might expect,","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/56.mp3"},{"answer":"like do you like working under pressure or...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/57.mp3"},{"answer":"are you good at keeping deadlines.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/58.mp3"},{"answer":"And what if people can see through them and just write what they think the employer wants to see?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/59.mp3"},{"answer":"Well that's always a possibility.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/60.mp3"},{"answer":"I mean, it's human nature to lie, isn't it?","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/61.mp3"},{"answer":"Well, that's the point.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/62.mp3"},{"answer":"Apparently it isn't.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/63.mp3"},{"answer":"These tests are compiled by experts","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/64.mp3"},{"answer":"and they believe that the answers can provide a few simple indicators","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/65.mp3"},{"answer":"as to roughly the type of person that you are...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/66.mp3"},{"answer":"that people will generally be truthful in that situation.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/66-2024-01-31-22-23-05.mp3"},{"answer":"And then you can go some way towards finding out whether someone's, say, forward-looking...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/68.mp3"},{"answer":"a go-ahead type of person... or resistant to change.","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/69.mp3"},{"answer":"And there are all kinds of...","audio":"https://dailydictation.com/upload/ielts-listening/ielts-cambridge-3-test-2-part-3-2023-08-15-21-28-04/70.mp3"}]
